\title{0.7 Gates of the changed defaults, and what was changed}

\p{Everything is on \code{\verb~|work/b2/dist-c~} - the published \code{\verb~|rlvm-main~} \code{\verb~|21150203e39d~} and \code{\verb~|rlvm-cli~} \code{\verb~|cac1433b287a~} with the other jars as published at 22:32Z - unless a row names another distribution.}

