\tr{\th{Configuration}\th{CPU time / \code{\verb~|jvm~} (median; range)}\th{Wall / \code{\verb~|jvm~}}\th{Peak RSS / \code{\verb~|jvm~}}\th{Instructions / \code{\verb~|jvm~}}\th{Pairs}}
