\p{The verdicts and the machine's own counters, taken outside the timed runs (\code{\verb~|work/steward/w7/accept.sh~}: the image of the measured distribution, \code{\verb~|-X engine=machine -X stats-file=...~}, four workers, on the host's efficiency cores; \code{\verb~|work/steward/w7/stats/*.json~}): on the eight corpora that ran to the end the machine decided every unit it was given and the reference engine re-checked none, so the figures of this part contain no fallback work. The mathlib run was stopped after 23 minutes on the thrashing host without a result.}

